      "input": {
        "key": "Checkout.Title",
        "locale": "en"
      },
      "partition": "requiredPortableIds",
      "notes": "A per-call locale must override the ambient supplier, or the two ingresses are not separable."
    },
    {
      "id": "ingress-smoke.fabricated.supplied-match-is-preserved-not-rederived",
      "requirementIds": [],
      "fixture": "ingress-smoke-fabricated-match",
      "operation": "getResult",
      "input": {
        "key": "Checkout.Title"
      },
      "partition": "requiredPortableIds",
      "notes": "THE SHARP CASE: the supplied match claims EXACT on fr while naming de as its range. If the library re-derived the match instead of preserving it, the reported range and type would differ."
